          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770012547829"
          },
          "code": "SEARCH_NODE",
          "id": "1768232027934",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773288897669_1",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Get the latest 5 models (Created On Recently): Resource ID,Model Name, Description, Algorithm Used, Created On, Last Scored.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in the following format:\n\n{\n  \"models\": [\n    {\n     \"id\":\"<resource id>\",\n      \"name\": \"<model name>\",\n      \"description\": \"<model description>\",\n      \"algorithm\": \"<algorithm>\",\n      \"createdOn\": \"<created timestamp>\",\n      \"lastScored\": \"<last scored timestamp>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "AGENT"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Format Output"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FORMAT_OUTPUT",
          "id": "1770012547829",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770012547831_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a specialized UI rendering assistant for Model Qualification results.\n\nYour task is to format the output from the Search Node into a structured, user-friendly list for display in the App (InitDisplay).\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nInput Data\n--------------------------------------------------\nModel Data:\n{{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_NODE.$output}}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nDisplay Title\n--------------------------------------------------\n\"Discover models available within Fusion CDP to solve key business problems and deliver measurable value\"\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nFields to Display (per model)\n--------------------------------------------------\n1) Model Name\n   - Map from model name in the input data\n\n2) Description\n   - Map from model description\n   - If unavailable, leave empty (do NOT generate text)\n\n3) Algorithm\n   - Map from algorithm name used by the model\n\n4) Created On\n   - Map from model creation timestamp\n\n5) Last Scored\n   - Map from last scored timestamp\n   - If unavailable, leave empty\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nAction Logic\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Each model MUST include an action.\n- Use the ReviewModelLatest command.\n\nUse this format exactly:\n\nora.Invoke(\"ReviewModelLatest\", {\n  \"action\": \"ReviewModelLatest\",\n  \"model\": \"<Model Name>\",\n  \"label\": \"Review <Model Name>\",\n\"id\":\"<id>\"\n})\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nOutput Rules (STRICT)\n--------------------------------------------------\n- Do NOT output JSON.\n- Do NOT wrap output in code blocks.\n- Do NOT invent or hardcode any values.\n- Preserve the order of models from input.\n- If no models are available, display an empty list.\n- Do NOT mention widget names, XML, or internal components.\n- Output must be suitable for InitDisplay rendering.\n- Sort By Created On Descending Order\n- Don't Include Resource ID column. It should be mapped only on the Ora.Invoke"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
